{title: A Long Tune}
{artist: Campfire Tests}
{key: G}

{start_of_verse}
[G]A verse of chords stands [D]before the long tune
[Em]Its lines are as wide as the [C]columns they are in
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_grid: Outro}
| G . . . | D . . . | Em . . . | C . . . |
{end_of_grid}

